# Infra management (personal VPS scripts). Ignored, except the disk-cleanup
# script: cron and the NOPASSWD sudoers rule hard-code its path, so losing it
# (a repo cleanup deleted it in 2026-08) let the disk refill silently.
infra/*
!infra/vps-disk-cleanup.sh

